</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/" aria-current="page">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</p><h1>Make the digital journey clearer, faster and easier to act on.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">We help organisations improve customer-facing websites, web products and mobile journeys when the experience is unclear, unreliable, difficult to measure or no longer supports the service.</p><a class="button button--primary page-hero__action" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div><div class="page-hero__graphic"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="digital-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Common problems</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h2 id="digital-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>When to ask for help</h2><ul class="trigger-list" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Visitors struggle to understand what you offer, find the information they need or make an enquiry.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>A website is slow, difficult to maintain or unreliable on mobile.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Enquiries arrive, but their source and quality are unclear.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>A portal, ecommerce flow or member journey creates avoidable friction.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>A legacy web platform needs a repair, redesign or staged replacement decision.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Analytics or technical search foundations are incomplete or misleading.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="deliverables-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Deliverables</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h2 id="deliverables-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>What we deliver</h2><div class="deliverables-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="deliverable-card" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h3 data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Websites &amp; CMS Improvements</h3><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Accessible, fast and maintainable websites built with clean content structures and manageable editing workflows.</p></div><div class="deliverable-card" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h3 data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Portals &amp; Member Journeys</h3><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Self-service customer and member portals covering registration, account access, booking and payment flows.</p></div><div class="deliverable-card" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h3 data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Technical SEO &amp; Search Visibility</h3><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Structured data, crawlability and technical foundations helping search engines understand and index your services.</p></div><div class="deliverable-card" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h3 data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Mobile Usability &amp; Performance</h3><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Core Web Vitals optimisation, responsive layouts and streamlined form journeys tested on real mobile devices.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="digital-decision-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Decision</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h2 id="digital-decision-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Improve the journey before assuming it needs a rebuild.</h2><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>We can review content and navigation, improve page performance, repair an existing site or plan a staged redesign. Agree the website, portal, ecommerce and measurement features you need before build work starts. We agree useful measures at the start and use them to assess improvements.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="health-check-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Self-check</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h2 id="health-check-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Seven checks for a clearer business website</h2><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Can a new visitor understand your offer, use the site on a phone and complete the main enquiry task? Use this practical checklist to identify three improvements and choose one change to make first:</p><ol class="health-checklist" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Clear offer:</strong> Does your homepage headline explain what you do and who you help within five seconds?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Obvious next step:</strong> Is the primary action (discuss project, request quote, or view pricing) visible without scrolling through paragraphs?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Phone layout:</strong> Are font sizes readable (15–18px), buttons easy to tap (min 44px), and side margins preserved on mobile screens?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Navigation clarity:</strong> Can a visitor find your core services, about information, and contact details within two taps?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Form completion &amp; confirmation:</strong> Does your enquiry form validate inputs cleanly and confirm what happens after submission?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Consistent contact details:</strong> Are your physical office address, registered company details, and direct email address current across all pages?</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Measurable assessment:</strong> Do you have a baseline metric (enquiry completion, bounce rate, or core page visits) to evaluate whether updates actually helped?</li></ol><div class="health-check-cta" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=website-audit" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Discuss your website priorities</a></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Sample deliverable</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><h2 id="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>What you receive: prioritised website audit and interface specification</h2><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Before committing to redesigns or new builds, we deliver an actionable assessment identifying layout friction, mobile rendering bottlenecks, and conversion drops.</p><div class="deliverable-spec-card" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Starting problem</span><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>High mobile bounce rate, ambiguous service hierarchy, and complex contact forms that discourage enquiries.</p></div><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Example outputs included in the pack</span><ul class="spec-list" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Mobile viewport evaluation:</strong> Verified rendering down to 320px width, font readability (15–18px), and 44px minimum tap targets.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Content &amp; CTA hierarchy:</strong> Plain-language value statement, removal of repeated marketing copy, and prominent conversion routes.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Accessible enquiry flow:</strong> Transparent validation rules, instant feedback states, and clear receipt messaging.</li><li data-astro-cid-em36qbay><strong data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Prioritised punchlist:</strong> 3-tier remediation roadmap ranked by business impact versus engineering effort.</li></ul></div><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>What the client supplies</span><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Access to visitor analytics (if available), current brand identity assets, and common customer enquiry objections.</p></div><div class="spec-block spec-block--boundary" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>What needs separate agreement</span><p data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Complete multi-page rebranding, full CMS replatforming, continuous SEO retainers, or copy creation from scratch.</p></div><div class="spec-actions" data-astro-cid-em36qbay><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=website-specification" data-astro-cid-em36qbay>Discuss your website specification</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>Where does the digital journey lose clarity?</h2><p>Tell us what you want to improve, who uses the service and what outcome matters most.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>